# Bhavya AI Lab — Architectural Decision Record

**Date:** 2026-07-30
**Source:** ICM methodology analysis + Bhavya extensions
**Status:** Accepted

---

## Decision: Adopt, Modify, Extend ICM

### Three Ideas to Adopt Directly

| Principle | What It Means | Implementation |
|-----------|---------------|----------------|
| **CLAUDE.md is NOT documentation** | Identity, routing table, folder map, naming rules only. Under one screen. | Rewrite CLAUDE.md to be minimal |
| **Context belongs where work happens** | Each workspace knows only its domain. Major token optimization. | Move voice/audience/rules into workspace-level contexts |
| **Workspace ≠ Folder** | Workspace = change in mental mode. Steps inside a workspace are not workspaces. | Research → Curriculum → Production → Platform are workspaces. Draft/Review/Edit are steps inside Curriculum. |

### Two Ideas to Modify

| Principle | Modification | Reason |
|-----------|--------------|--------|
| **Context should describe the work** | Instead of "You are an amazing AI", provide: audience, constraints, learning objectives, misconceptions | AI needs concrete task info, not personality instructions |
| **Context is living documentation** | Every CONTEXT.md includes: Last Updated, Current Goal, Known Constraints, Open Questions, Recent Decisions, Next Review | Treat as working documents, not static specs |

### One Idea to Extend

| Extension | What | Why |
|-----------|------|-----|
| **Structured Registries** | `_config/registries/` with components, prompts, schemas, remotion, diagrams, layouts | Reusable assets referenced by all workspaces. Not workspaces themselves. |

### Additional Extensions

| Extension | What | Why |
|-----------|------|-----|
| **Build Targets** | Lesson → Website, Video, Slides, Workbook, Quiz, Flashcards, Teacher Guide | Every artifact becomes a build target |
| **Knowledge Objects** | Atomic units: Concept, Definition, Example, Misconception, Exercise, Reference, Metadata | Content easier to reuse and maintain |
| **Compiler Layer** | Knowledge → Lesson → Assessment → Visual Spec → Remotion → Video → Offline Package → Website | Orchestrates pipeline while each workspace contributes one stage |

